athML\" display=\"block\"><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></msqrt><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div>",
